{"path":"chemistry/experiments/lab/solution-prep-error","title":"配制溶液误差分析（定容俯仰视）","type":"example","html":"<p>用固体 NaCl 配制 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500\\ \\mathrm{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mL</span></span></span></span></span> 一定物质的量浓度的溶液，下列操作会使所配溶液浓度<strong>偏高</strong>的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 定容时仰视刻度线</p>\n<p>B. 定容时俯视刻度线</p>\n<p>C. 定容摇匀后发现液面低于刻度线，又滴加蒸馏水至刻度线</p>\n<p>D. 洗涤液未转移至容量瓶中</p>\n<ul>\n<li>俯视/仰视的方向感：俯视时眼睛在刻度线上方，视线斜向下，看到&quot;水到 500 mL&quot;其实水还没到——所以水少、浓；仰视相反；</li>\n<li>完整流程易错点清单：①称量台纸（吸潮称量偏差）；②转移时玻璃棒引流（泼洒=低）；③<strong>容量瓶不需干燥</strong>（原液加水即可）；④用容量瓶定容前先润洗？<strong>不能润洗</strong>（会改变浓度）；⑤未洗涤烧杯和玻璃棒（溶质残留=低）；</li>\n<li>天平称量固体一般用<strong>烧杯或纸片</strong>承载，NaOH 等易潮解物质应放在小烧杯中称量；</li>\n<li>变式：量筒量取浓溶液稀释时，量筒<strong>俯视读数偏大</strong>（读到目标刻度时实际液面偏低，取液<strong>偏少</strong>→溶质偏少→稀释后浓度偏低）；&quot;加液时俯视&quot;偏差方向相同（读大→实际不足），不存在&quot;相反”——量筒是&quot;量出&quot;仪器，与容量瓶&quot;量入&quot;的定容误差方向相反；</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>误差分析的两条主线</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=\\dfrac{n}{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>——溶质 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 偏大或体积 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span></span> 偏大，分别导致浓度偏高/偏低。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定容时<strong>仰视</strong>刻度线：视线偏低→所看刻度&quot;提前到达&quot;→实际加水<strong>偏多</strong> ⇒ 体积偏大 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span> <strong>偏低</strong>；</li>\n<li>定容时<strong>俯视</strong>刻度线：视线偏高→实际加水<strong>偏少</strong> ⇒ 体积偏小 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span> <strong>偏高</strong> ✓；</li>\n<li>摇匀后液面下降再补加水：下降是正常的（少量液体附着器壁），再补水 ⇒ 体积偏大 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span> 偏低；</li>\n<li>洗涤液未转移：溶质损失 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 偏小 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span> 偏低。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>B</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>&quot;俯高仰低&quot;口诀</strong>：定容时——</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>俯视 → 水少 → 浓度高</strong>（比想象中浓）；</li>\n<li><strong>仰视 → 水多 → 浓度低</strong>；</li>\n</ul>\n<p>再记&quot;<strong>摇匀后别补</strong>&quot;（补了必低）、&quot;<strong>洗涤必须转</strong>&quot;（不转必低）。30 秒选 B。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"用固体 NaCl 配制 500 m L 500\\ \\mathrm{mL} 500 mL 一定物质的量浓度的溶液，下列操作会使所配溶液浓度 偏高 的是（ ） A. 定容时仰视刻度线 B. 定容时俯视刻度线 C. 定容摇匀后发现液面低于刻度线，","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"实验选填/实验题","risk":"误差分析永远往\"溶质少了还是多了、溶液体积大了还是小了\"两头上靠；定容俯视/仰视是\"视线位置决定加水量\"的高频坑。","fit":["一定物质的量浓度溶液的配制","操作误差对浓度的影响","选填/实验题"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"lab","title":"化学实验"},{"slug":"solution-prep-error","title":"配制溶液误差分析（定容俯仰视）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"design-evaluation","title":"实验方案设计与评价","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"化学实验专题","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"gas-prep","title":"气体制备与净化（先除杂后干燥）","type":"example"},{"slug":"gas-purify","title":"气体净化与干燥顺序（除杂为先、干燥在后）","type":"example"},{"slug":"haloalkane-br-test","title":"溴乙烷中溴元素的检验","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-flow-example","title":"工业流程除杂（调 pH 不引杂质）","type":"example"},{"slug":"industrial-process","title":"化学工艺流程题模板","type":"knowledge"}]}